Boundary notes:
  identity-access-management = ARCHITECTURE + CROSS-PLATFORM + CONCEPTS (AuthN/AuthZ, federation,
  provisioning + JML lifecycle, MFA strategy, access control models, governance, zero trust,
  IdP/IGA selection). Platform-specific implementation lives in the eleven vendor skills.
  No content duplication: the vendor skills cover Conditional Access / Okta Workflows / Keycloak
  realms / AWS policy language / AD replication specifics; this umbrella covers the conceptual,
  comparative, and selection layer and routes to them.
  entra-app-lifecycle (existing vault skill) owns the Entra ID app-REGISTRATION lifecycle
  (app type to OAuth flow, MSAL, service principals, API permission grants, federated identity
  credentials); the entra-id vendor skill (IAM PR3) owns the Entra ID PLATFORM/ADMIN surface
  (Conditional Access, PIM, Identity Protection, Entra Connect, B2B/B2C, governance). This
  umbrella routes to both and duplicates neither.

